(7421467, 1171223, 38032, '<td valign="top">This is great but falls into that NON-GRAY area! ;)<br/>I kind of hope to see this on the front page just for the controversy! =)</td>', 'This is great but falls into that NON-GRAY area! ;)I kind of hope to see this on the front page just for the controversy! =)', '2015-12-09 11:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421519, 1171318, 60581, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot!</td>', 'Interesting shot!', '2015-12-09 14:25:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421545, 1171306, 60495, '<td valign="top">I love the idea of this shot but find the crop to be a little awkward, the section on the left just lacks any interest yet competes with the rest of the shot.</td>', 'I love the idea of this shot but find the crop to be a little awkward, the section on the left just lacks any interest yet competes with the rest of the shot.', '2015-12-09 15:57:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421559, 1171298, 173844, '<td valign="top">The line of dancers has been processed into almost abstraction, with just enough left to elicit enjoyable recognition.  Take away that recognition and the white shapes are lovely to behold.  The undulation of the black above, and the squiggles, enhances the sinuous rhythm.  Exquisite.  My favorite in the challenge.</td>', 'The line of dancers has been processed into almost abstraction, with just enough left to elicit enjoyable recognition.  Take away that recognition and the white shapes are lovely to behold.  The undulation of the black above, and the squiggles, enhances the sinuous rhythm.  Exquisite.  My favorite in the challenge.', '2015-12-09 17:18:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421608, 1171269, 173844, '<td valign="top">You''ve impressively drawn the essence out of these reflected tree branches and trunk (I think it''s that).  One can wander delightedly through the lines, finding all sorts of suggestive glimmers of images.  Jackson Pollock, move over.</td>', 'You''ve impressively drawn the essence out of these reflected tree branches and trunk (I think it''s that).  One can wander delightedly through the lines, finding all sorts of suggestive glimmers of images.  Jackson Pollock, move over.', '2015-12-09 22:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421609, 1171331, 173844, '<td valign="top">Once I saw the evocative title I could summon up no other interpretation.  And it''s terrific, deeply emotional, moving.  This shimmers.</td>', 'Once I saw the evocative title I could summon up no other interpretation.  And it''s terrific, deeply emotional, moving.  This shimmers.', '2015-12-09 23:01:32.000000', NULL, 1),
