(7421728, 1171282, 19825, '<td valign="top">Interesting work.</td>', 'Interesting work.', '2015-12-10 18:25:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421729, 1171271, 19825, '<td valign="top">Nice. I sorta wish you hadn''t told me what it was.</td>', 'Nice. I sorta wish you hadn''t told me what it was.', '2015-12-10 18:26:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421730, 1170906, 19825, '<td valign="top">You have a lot going on here. Nice image.</td>', 'You have a lot going on here. Nice image.', '2015-12-10 18:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421741, 1171169, 173844, '<td valign="top">This tornadic blur of leaves leaves me all aflutter.  With pleasure, that is.  Lovely abstractification (to coin a word) from center to the outer whirls.  So much so that the upper left corner looks like the ocean stretching to the horizon.  The multifarious tones are beautiful.  Fine image.</td>', 'This tornadic blur of leaves leaves me all aflutter.  With pleasure, that is.  Lovely abstractification (to coin a word) from center to the outer whirls.  So much so that the upper left corner looks like the ocean stretching to the horizon.  The multifarious tones are beautiful.  Fine image.', '2015-12-10 20:25:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421745, 1171280, 173844, '<td valign="top">This interlocking tangle, revealed to be a heart, now offers up so many meanings and speculations to play with.  The entanglements of love, the hidden connections, the sum of all those paths, taken and untaken.  Very imaginative and rewarding.  I love the sense of depth, in keeping with the whole exploration.</td>', 'This interlocking tangle, revealed to be a heart, now offers up so many meanings and speculations to play with.  The entanglements of love, the hidden connections, the sum of all those paths, taken and untaken.  Very imaginative and rewarding.  I love the sense of depth, in keeping with the whole exploration.', '2015-12-10 20:43:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421746, 1171317, 173844, '<td valign="top">Dazzling abstraction elicited by cleverly angling this modern building (as I think it is).  Keeps the eyes zigzagging about, trying to make sense of it, manically trying to pin it down.  A dangerous flirtation.  Nice going.</td>', 'Dazzling abstraction elicited by cleverly angling this modern building (as I think it is).  Keeps the eyes zigzagging about, trying to make sense of it, manically trying to pin it down.  A dangerous flirtation.  Nice going.', '2015-12-10 20:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421747, 1171079, 173844, '<td valign="top">Wonderful title and, upon living with it for a minute, satisfyingly suitable.  I couldn''t say why I''m won over.  Maybe it''s intuition, maybe gullibility.  It''s unpretentious and ephemeral.  A fresh look at the world.</td>', 'Wonderful title and, upon living with it for a minute, satisfyingly suitable.  I couldn''t say why I''m won over.  Maybe it''s intuition, maybe gullibility.  It''s unpretentious and ephemeral.  A fresh look at the world.', '2015-12-10 21:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421749, 1171328, 173844, '<td valign="top">Gleaming and beautiful, like the iridescence of a butterfly wing.  Great palette of grays and whites to elicit this effect.  Could even be rice paddies on a mountainside.</td>', 'Gleaming and beautiful, like the iridescence of a butterfly wing.  Great palette of grays and whites to elicit this effect.  Could even be rice paddies on a mountainside.', '2015-12-10 21:12:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421753, 1170918, 173844, '<td valign="top">Perhaps even more than an abstract, and a good one at that, this could called op-art.  It vibrates the brain and jangles the nerves.  Provocative in many ways.</td>', 'Perhaps even more than an abstract, and a good one at that, this could called op-art.  It vibrates the brain and jangles the nerves.  Provocative in many ways.', '2015-12-10 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421758, 1171033, 173844, '<td valign="top">Plucked from the everyday by a photographer with a good eye.  Intricate, well-composed and suggestive.  The great detail lends intimacy to this almost other-worldly scene and, along with the uncertainty of shape and form, approaches abstraction from two directions.  Also, both muscular and delicate.</td>', 'Plucked from the everyday by a photographer with a good eye.  Intricate, well-composed and suggestive.  The great detail lends intimacy to this almost other-worldly scene and, along with the uncertainty of shape and form, approaches abstraction from two directions.  Also, both muscular and delicate.', '2015-12-10 22:12:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421759, 1171306, 173844, '<td valign="top">Looks like an ambitious stage set of a forest.  Or cotton candy on fire.  The delicate interweaving of tones is quite pleasing.</td>', 'Looks like an ambitious stage set of a forest.  Or cotton candy on fire.  The delicate interweaving of tones is quite pleasing.', '2015-12-10 22:18:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421761, 1171305, 173844, '<td valign="top">Despite the vertical central stripe, this is still dramatically composed and visually stirring.</td>', 'Despite the vertical central stripe, this is still dramatically composed and visually stirring.', '2015-12-10 22:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421764, 1170943, 173844, '<td valign="top">Sports car, spider or galaxion, this is enjoyable to ponder.  The selective focus is deftly placed.  Looks like a bright future ahead.</td>', 'Sports car, spider or galaxion, this is enjoyable to ponder.  The selective focus is deftly placed.  Looks like a bright future ahead.', '2015-12-10 22:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421765, 1171103, 173844, '<td valign="top">The blurred focus here enables whatever this is to become abstracted, and now there''s something visually interesting.  It has the rhythm of a mobile.  Very nice.</td>', 'The blurred focus here enables whatever this is to become abstracted, and now there''s something visually interesting.  It has the rhythm of a mobile.  Very nice.', '2015-12-10 22:29:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421774, 1171318, 50695, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what to make of this. I want to know how you did this. is this a sculpture? an installation?</td>', 'I don''t know what to make of this. I want to know how you did this. is this a sculpture? an installation?', '2015-12-10 22:36:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(7421776, 1170985, 50695, '<td valign="top">so strange but compelling</td>', 'so strange but compelling', '2015-12-10 22:37:49.000000', NULL, 1),
