(7421921, 1171033, 86447, '<td valign="top">Greetings from the Critique Club, Susan!  <br/> <br/>I should have known not to click for an image just after an abstract challenge, Ha!  They''re not "my thing".<br/> <br/>I gave this a five during voting, so I''m not sure that I''m the best person to critique this for you.  Or... maybe I am because... everyone else loved it!  <br/>   I couldn''t figure out the hoarfrost... I thought they were like a prisoner scratching the days, too.  <br/> <br/>The large, upper left triangle has nothing of interest in it (to me)... so it''s almost like negative space to me.  Then, when I got to the subject, I still wasn''t excited.  And, it all seems horribly over sharpened to me. <br/> <br/>I do love the veins in the leaves on the right.  They''re quite lovely.<br/> <br/> <br/> <br/></td>', 'Greetings from the Critique Club, Susan!   I should have known not to click for an image just after an abstract challenge, Ha!  They''re not "my thing". I gave this a five during voting, so I''m not sure that I''m the best person to critique this for you.  Or... maybe I am because... everyone else loved it!     I couldn''t figure out the hoarfrost... I thought they were like a prisoner scratching the days, too.   The large, upper left triangle has nothing of interest in it (to me)... so it''s almost like negative space to me.  Then, when I got to the subject, I still wasn''t excited.  And, it all seems horribly over sharpened to me.  I do love the veins in the leaves on the right.  They''re quite lovely.   ', '2015-12-11 13:13:38.000000', NULL, 0),
