(7422712, 1170892, 142425, '<td valign="top">Simple set up, just a rolled A4 sheet on a light pad, converted to B&amp;W in Lightroom, blurred in Photoshop and back into Lightroom for final adjustments. I''d like to say it took days of blood sweat and tears but the whole process took less than half an hour. Thanks for the votes.</td>', 'Simple set up, just a rolled A4 sheet on a light pad, converted to B&W in Lightroom, blurred in Photoshop and back into Lightroom for final adjustments. I''d like to say it took days of blood sweat and tears but the whole process took less than half an hour. Thanks for the votes.', '2015-12-17 04:10:55.000000', NULL, 0),
